        "char_che_qiao_xiang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Kong Ri Tian appears, Zuo Wu Sheng and Che You Yin show intense fear and name him. Narration places the two as the main fighters, both injured and only rank three. After the petal assault they sigh in relief when he seems to retreat, then their faces change. Zuo Wu Sheng cries out for Chan Yu as Kong Ri Tian holds the unconscious Zuo Chan Yu and Che Qiao Xiang. The three kings inheritance pillars then erupt.",
      "chapters": [
        323
      ],
